<div mt-section-origin="Bookshelves/General_Chemistry/Chemistry_1e_(OpenSTAX)/05:_Thermochemistry/5.02:_Energy_Basics" class="mt-section"><span id="Key_Equations"></span><h2 class="lt-chem-38165 editable">Key Equations</h2>
</div></section>

